Before the death of Yoon Dong-hee's attending doctor

30
00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.320
The last person to call was the director of the National Forensic Hospital

31
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.160
Dean?

32
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.320
He may be the mastermind behind letting Yoon Dong Hee go.

33
