Or the next target

34
00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.760
I think it's one of the two

35
00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.240
So which one do you think is more likely?

36
00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:00.720
I'm also curious

37
00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.479
So I plan to meet him in person

38
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.320
(12-1, Murin-ro 9-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul)

39
00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.240
it's me

40
