(35LA6645)

52
00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.120
Sir

53
00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.039
are you okay

54
00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.039
Yoon Dong Hee

55
00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:35.960
(President Shin Project)

56
00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.959
(Episode 9)

57
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.440
Sir

58
00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.040
Sir, wake up

59
00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:44.959
Sir

60
00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.480
The patient suffered a stab wound to the abdomen

61
00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.240
The bleeding was quite severe and there may have been damage to the retroperitoneum as well.

62
00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.840
Hurry up and arrange the operating room. Let’s do a computed tomography scan first.
(Accident and Emergency Department)

63
00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.160
Are you a general surgeon?

64
00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.559
No, I am a specialist nurse

65
00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:24.079
(operating room)

66
00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.120
Dean

67
00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.440
Sorry, I didn't catch him

68
00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.080
Don't say that. I'm sorry.

69
00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.120
The detective blocked the knife for me

70
00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.840
We will definitely catch him

71
00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:43.200
But Yoon Dong-hee

72
00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.400
How do you know where your home is?

73
00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.560
I don't understand how he knew either

74
00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.560
Did Yin Dongxi tell you something?

75
00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.400
It happened so suddenly...

76
00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.280
I have applied for personal safety protection on your behalf

77
00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.040
The police are waiting for you outside

78
00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:58.960
thank you

79
00:05:59.040 --> 00:05:59.919
No

80
00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.320
How is Detective Choi doing?

81
00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.440
He is in the operating room

82
00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.040
The process still needs to be observed

83
00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.240
Are you Dean Li Xujun?

84
00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:20.520
yes

85
00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.760
I want to ask you something

86
00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.840
Why did Yin Dongxi want to kill the dean?

87
00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.240
And also in public

88
00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:28.440
But…

89
00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:30.480
who are you?

90
00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.400
Doesn't look like a police officer

91
00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.640
I was 15 years ago...

92
00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.239
The person who lost his son because of Yoon Dong Hee

93
00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.400
I'm so sorry

94
00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.600
Failure to manage prisoners properly

95
00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.119
I have to take a lot of responsibility

96
00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.920
You and Yin Dongxi

97
00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.720
When did you meet?

98
00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.399
We don't have a personal relationship

99
00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.880
Only some patients

100
00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.040
When you feel angry or aggrieved about your situation

101
00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.280
will be projected onto the person in charge

102
00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.520
their way

103
00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.840
May be irrational and bizarre

104
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.200
Even violent

105
00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.480
stab someone with a knife

106
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.960
Can you describe it as bizarre?

107
00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.760
I mean

108
00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:22.280
Some patients also express emotions in distorted ways

109
00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.360
Really?

110
00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:30.080
By the way, I also want to ask you something

111
00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.240
Do you know that Yin Dongxi will come to me?

112
00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.719
Is that why you appeared there?

113
00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.560
No, I went there out of curiosity.

114
00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:40.240
What are you curious about?

115
00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.160
Detective Choi told me

116
00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.000
The person who last spoke to Yoon Dong-hee’s doctor

117
00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.280
Either he's the mastermind behind it, he's the next target.

118
00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.160
Can't escape these two

119
00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.160
So I want to confirm

120
00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:01.680
Have you checked my call history?

121
00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:02.440
No

122
00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.919
Just happened to know

123
00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.120
Yoon Dong Hee

124
00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.800
Am I the mastermind behind him?

125
00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.999
Although this is really unfair to me

126
00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.280
But did you get the answer you wanted?

127
00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.399
I'm very sorry if any offense was caused.

128
00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.040
Ah doctor

129
00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.680
The operation was successful

130
00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:30.520
(Operating room) (Family waiting room)

131
00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:31.880
Although the wound is deep

132
00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.720
But luckily no internal organs were injured

133
00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.080
thank you doctor

134
00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.920
Then it shouldn't be life-threatening, right?

135
00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:37.759
yes

136
00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:42.680
are you sure

137
00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.240
No money was credited to Yin Dongxi's account today?

138
00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.080
Just say no more

139
00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.520
What? Did anyone have an accident again?

140
00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:50.920
That bastard Yoon Dong Hee...

141
00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.039
Just showed up with a knife.

142
00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.240
"The number you dialed is not answered"

143
00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.879
"Forwarded to your voice mailbox"

144
00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:33.000
are you okay

145
00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.120
Detective Choi

146
00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.440
No, don't move yet

147
00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.480
The person who last spoke to Yoon Dong-hee’s doctor

148
00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:38.640
Not the mastermind

149
00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.200
It's the next target

150
00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.440
Am I the mastermind behind him?

151
00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.639
Although this is really unfair to me

152
00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.599
But did you get the answer you wanted?

153
00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.080
(Representative Kim)

154
00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.200
Yeah

155
00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.720
Brother, I have prepared everything.

156
00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.240
I haven't been able to contact you for a while.

157
00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.600
He hasn't come to work for a long time

158
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.159
Oh wait for me a moment

159
00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.280
"The number you dialed is unavailable"

160
00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.560
Even the number has been changed

161
00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.880
Did he make up his mind to run away?

162
00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.120
Do Dong-seok?

163
00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.960
Yes, it seems he changed his phone number.

164
00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.680
I want to ask senior if you know his phone number

165
00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.120
Don't know

166
00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.400
Has his suspension expired?

167
00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.080
Suspension?

168
00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.240
Lawyer Du Dongxi’s suspension expired in January this year

169
00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:55.599
If it were January…

170
00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.360
Then he was hiding the fact that he was suspended.

171
00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.080
Also took over the job of legal advisor

172
00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:03.999
(Fried Chicken Headquarters)

173
00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.920
As an independent and equal business entity

174
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.160
Employees can decide their own working hours

175
00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.840
There will be no penalty for absence or tardiness

176
00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.200
In fact, the punishment is very severe

177
00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:16.360
Not only do you have to pay a late fee, but class fees will also be deducted.

178
00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.080
That's right. What about this part?

179
00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:21.080
Work attire and maintenance of tidy work area

180
00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.880
He would ask us to clean like crazy

181
00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:24.480
Dumbbells should be wiped clean one by one

182
00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.760
If the mirror gets a little fingerprint on it, it will go crazy

183
00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.760
That means you have all been punished, right?

184
00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:32.920
Yes, as long as you are late, you will have to pay an additional late fee.

185
00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.200
Then there is evidence

186
00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.560
If the employer has clearly designated starting and ending times

187
00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.640
If there are also punishment rules

188
00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.600
Then prove that the other party regards you as an employee and gives you work instructions.

189
00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.080
If you file a lawsuit like this

190
00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.800
The court has the opportunity to determine that you are an employee

191
00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.960
I originally wanted to use tricks, but I was bitten back on this point.

192
00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:50.240
Not bad

193
00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:53.200
But...how long will this lawsuit take?

194
00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.640
Preliminary results will be available in about a year

195
00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:56.680
One year?

196
00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.480
We were held back for six months just on salary.

197
00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:00.720
I…

198
00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.800
Can't wait that long

199
00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:06.119
I don't have the strength or capital to wait any longer.

200
00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:08.840
Must be established

201
00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.600
Is there no other way?

202
00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:14.439
Which article of the law, etc.

203
00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.959
So what do you think?

204
00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:27.840
Sister

205
00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.879
Why are you here by yourself?

206
00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.720
I kept talking about going to Bali all day long and it ended up like this

207
00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.199
It’s really been a long time since I drank.

208
00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.920
Why does my sister want to go to Bali?

209
00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.360
It's so breathless here

210
00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.360
I originally thought that after working for a long time, my condition would get better.

211
00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:56.720
I thought that if I just endured it, everything would be fine.

212
00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.840
In the end, I found myself being kicked around like a rubber ball.

213
00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.200
In the end I left nothing behind

214
00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:09.080
In the end it became I didn’t even know what I really wanted to do

215
00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.559
Already forgotten

216
00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:13.960
Yes

217
00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.520
until recently

218
00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:21.840
I still feel that what I want to do is not important at all

219
00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.599
So…

220
00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.480
I will be very grateful to Lawyer Cao

221
00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.440
why

222
00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.280
because he told me

223
00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.840
It is not a matter of course to live a life under the feet of others.

224
00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.680
Wait until all the colleagues in the fitness room get their arrears of salary

225
00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.080
and after all members’ contracts have been fulfilled

226
00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.640
I just want to think carefully

227
00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:53.959
What do you want to do?

228
00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.360
Be careful on the road

229
00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.960
Do you have an appointment later?

230
00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:09.800
Ah, yes, because I have access control

231
00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.440
Walk slowly and thank you for the hospitality

232
00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.680
See you next time

233
00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:18.919
I will contact you again

234
00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.519
What's wrong?

235
00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.800
What are you really doing?

236
00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.840
Eat some even if you have no appetite

237
00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.040
you lost so much blood

238
00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.120
I need to eat something to make up for it.

239
00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:57.920
Hello

240
00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.200
I'm so angry that my blood is pouring out now

241
00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.280
And I was stabbed in the stomach

242
00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.560
Hands are still fine

243
00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.800
I will eat it myself

244
00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.480
Don't do this kind of thing

245
00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.360
Haven’t you found Yoon Dong-hee’s car yet?

246
00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:10.440
Forget it

247
00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:13.040
The team leader said he would never let go of anyone who dared to touch his people.

248
00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.560
Now I'm looking for a car myself

249
00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.320
Haven't you already adjusted the traffic CCTV?

250
00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.320
I didn’t take any photos after passing the big intersection.

251
00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.680
I watched it in the central control room for a while

252
00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.520
I just came here to help my seniors deliver food.

253
00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:24.760
Why do you need to prepare food for me?

254
00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.440
Abominable

255
00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.440
Hello

256
00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.720
I can eat by myself

257
00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.920
You'd better take care of the status of the case.

258
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.160
No

259
00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.680
The team leader asked me to stay with you until seniors finish eating.

260
00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.200
Stay away from me. I'm very stressed.

261
00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.479
Just eat a little, okay?

262
00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:47.760
Xiaojun's father

263
00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.320
You go out first

264
00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:50.839
OK

265
00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.640
Are you feeling better?

266
00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.520
我整个人瞬间清醒了

267
00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:02.080
Watching that guy run away made me angry.

268
00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.040
I was injured and felt very embarrassed.

269
00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.559
sorry

270
00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.840
It's all me irritating you

271
00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.280
That's why you got hurt

272
00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.280
That's not the case

273
00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:18.800
It is natural for the police to arrest criminals.

274
00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.040
thanks to this

275
00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:23.679
